**Sections:**
- **New & Upcoming**: Horizontal scroller with release date subtitles, sorted chronologically (upcoming first by soonest, then recent by most recent)
- **Your Collection**: Grid with search, genre filter, and sort controls

**Collection Controls:**
- **Search**: Filter by movie title (instant, no debounce)
- **Genre dropdown**: Filter by genre (populated from user's actual movie genres)
- **Sort dropdown**: Recently Added | Highest Rated | Newest First | Oldest First | Title A-Z

